<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso closes strong on inflows.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso closes strong on inflows.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- Feb 18 -------------------------</p>
<p>* Central Bank buys $90 million at 26.342</p>
<p>The Philippine peso finished higher on Tuesday at 26.340 from 26.344 on account of strong dollar inflows for investments, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was big selling pressure on the dollar,&quot; a trader from a big bank said.</p>
<p>Dealers said this prompted the Central Bank to buy $90 million, more than half the day's volume of $175 million.</p>
